# VIP reserV translation — INCOMPLETE (open work)

Resume: `@vip-i18n$` / `$vip-translate$`. Design: `.cursor/rules/design-notes-vip-reservations.mdc`, proposal `reports/vip-reservations-proposal.md` §16. Owner brand (Oct 16 2026): **VIP reserV**.

## State (Oct 16 2026)

| Piece | State |
|---|---|
| Feature | PROPOSAL — not built. When built, ships as beta (`vipReservations`, `IsTestFeature=1`) branded **VIP reserV**, in **English only** at first |
| Live gate | **VIP-P-15 C DECIDED:** English-only **Live is allowed**; translate after. This rule tracks translation work — it does **not** block `IsTestFeature→0` / Live |
| Chrome keys | Must be created as `vip.*` / `legalDocs.*` keys from the first build (no hardcoded strings), English values only until tiers run |
